<title>USA: N. Harris Mont. CCD, Texas $20 mln won by BancOne.</title>
<headline>N. Harris Mont. CCD, Texas $20 mln won by BancOne.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banc One Capital Markets said it won $20 million of North Harris Montgomery CCD, Texas, general obligation limited tax variable rate bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 3.89 percent.</p>
</text>
